<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-lone-star-shuffle" category="Crunch" order="50" instrument="guitar" style="Texas Blues">
  <description>A loud 4x10 blackface combo right at the edge with a green overdrive pushing it into crunch. Heavy strings and a hard right hand make it bark; the grit thickens as you dig in. Great for shuffles, bridge or middle pickup, and turns into a lead tone on the neck.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Blues</tag><tag>Texas Blues</tag><tag>Shuffle</tag><tag>Overdrive</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Lead</tag></tags>
  <sources>
